@title How to Read Your Quarterly Water Bill
@subtitle Tarn Valley Water

# Your bill at a glance

We send a bill every 3 months. It has three parts: what you used, a sewer charge, and a fixed service charge.

kpi Billing | Every 3 months | neutral
kpi Fixed service charge | $38.40 | per quarter | neutral
kpi Payment due | 21 days | after the issue date | neutral

# Usage charges

We measure your water in cubic meters (m3). The more you use, the more each extra m3 costs, in three tiers.

table = tier,usage,price per m3; Tier 1,First 30 m3,$1.85; Tier 2,Next 30 m3,$2.60; Tier 3,Above 60 m3,$3.90

The sewer charge is 80 percent of your usage charge.

## A worked example

A household used 72 m3 in the quarter.

table = line,how it works,amount; Tier 1,30 m3 at $1.85,$55.50; Tier 2,30 m3 at $2.60,$78.00; Tier 3,12 m3 at $3.90,$46.80; **Usage charge**,,**$180.30**; Sewer charge,80 percent of $180.30,$144.24; Fixed service charge,per quarter,$38.40; **Total**,,**$362.94**

# Fixed charges

The fixed service charge is $38.40 per quarter. It is the same no matter how much water you use.

# Ways to pay

Payment is due 21 days after the issue date.

- Online: tarnvalleywater.example/pay
- By phone: 555-0121
- In person: Main Street office, weekdays from 8:30 to 16:30

! Sign up for autopay and take 2 dollars off each bill.

# If you cannot pay on time

!! A late fee of 5 percent is added after 30 days.

Please call us on 555-0133 before the due date. We can set up a payment plan with you.
